@prefix ex:   <http://contoh.id/kampus/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:DosenTetap rdfs:subClassOf ex:Dosen .
ex:Dosen      rdfs:subClassOf <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .
ex:Mahasiswa  rdfs:subClassOf <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person> .

ex:budi a ex:DosenTetap .
ex:sari a ex:Dosen .
ex:andi a ex:Mahasiswa .